SUMMARY:Lake Area Artists 2026 Art Show and Sale
DESCRIPTION:The Lake Area Artists Show and Sale is a vibrant celebration of local creativity\, featuring over 400 original artworks from 30 juried members. This years event\, hosted at the Lakewood Center for the Arts in Lake Oswego\, OR promises a wide range of artist styles and media\, including water media\, oil\, acrylics encaustic\, paste and colored pencil. Whether you’re an art lover or looking to find a unique piece for your collection\, this is the event for you. Enjoy FREE admission\, FREE parking\, and a wheelchair accessible venue. It’s the perfect opportunity to explore the world of local art\, while supporting professional artists from the area. \nFor more information visit www.lakeareaartists.com \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/lake-area-artists-2026-art-show-and-sale/2026-04-24/
LOCATION:The Lakewood Center for the Arts in Lake Oswego
CATEGORIES:Arts/Crafts,Kids Calendar
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/LAA-small.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Lake Area Artists":MAILTO:laartistspdx@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
