SUMMARY:Celebration of Spring🌸Newroz🌸at Pioneer Square
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate the arrival of spring—NEWROZ—with us at Pioneer Square on Saturday\, April 25th. 🌿🔥✨ \nGet ready for an unforgettable evening filled with traditional Kurdish dancing\, electrifying live music\, and captivating performances. This free\, all-ages event is open to everyone\, so bring your friends and family! \nSavor the flavors of Kurdish culture with free snack samples\, kids activities and information booths. Let’s dance\, connect\, and welcome the new season together! 🌸🎶💃 \n📍 Pioneer Courthouse Square\n📅 Saturday\, April 25th 6p.m.-10p.m.\n🎟 Free & open to all! \nGo to IG @nomadicvintagepdx for updates. \nFree registration: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/newroz-spring-festival-tickets-1984488941846?aff=ebdssbdestsearch \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/celebration-of-spring%f0%9f%8c%b8newroz%f0%9f%8c%b8at-pioneer-square/
LOCATION:Pioneer Courthouse Square
CATEGORIES:Dance,Educational,Family Fun,Kids Calendar,Music,Outdoor
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/9APP06140.jpg
END:VEVENT
